            "地图长什么样，直接能放进游戏": "How the map looks - ready to drop into a game",
            "存档数据 JSON": "Save data (JSON)",
            "每一格是什么，给引擎和工具读": "Which tile sits in each cell, for engines and tools",
            "素材原图": "Source tilesets",
            "把素材图一起拷进包里，换台机器也能用": "Copy the tileset images in too, so the package works on another machine",
            "产出不止一个文件时自动打成一个 ZIP；只有一个文件时就直接给你那个文件。": "More than one file is packed into a single ZIP; a single file is handed to you as it is.",
            "至少勾一项要导出的内容。": "Choose at least one thing to export.",
            "最近一次导出：{n0} 个文件": "Last export: {n0} files",
            "下载 {n0}": "Download {n0}",
            "打包，含全部内容": "Bundle with everything",
            "另存为…": "Save as…",
            "下载走浏览器（默认进它的下载目录）；想自己挑位置就点「另存为…」。": "Downloads go through the browser (its download folder by default); use \"Save as…\" to pick the location yourself.",
            "下载走浏览器：文件会进它的下载目录（想每次都自己挑位置，在浏览器里打开「下载前询问保存位置」）。": "Downloads go through the browser: files land in its download folder (turn on \"Ask where to save each file\" in the browser to choose every time).",
            "这个浏览器不支持「另存为」，请用下载（位置由浏览器的下载设置决定）。": "This browser does not support \"Save as\" - use the download link instead (the browser decides the location).",
            "已保存到 {n0}": "Saved to {n0}",
            "另存为失败：{n0}": "Save as failed: {n0}",
            "还没有导出过，先点「导出」。现在打开的是项目目录。": "Nothing has been exported yet - press \"Export\" first. The project folder is open for now.",
            "已打开 {n0}": "Opened {n0}",
