            "标记": "Marker",
            "标记层": "Marker layer",
            "还没有标记。选「标记」工具，在地图上点一格。": "No markers yet. Pick the Marker tool and click a cell on the map.",
            "{n0} 个标记": "{n0} markers",
            "标记 {n0}": "Marker {n0}",
            "定位": "Go to",
